Package: quartoDocxAddin
Title: Render Quarto Documents to Word from RStudio
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      "Moronfoluwa", "Akintola",
      email = "folu.akintola@ndorms.ox.ac.uk",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides an RStudio addin that watches the active Quarto
    document, renders it to Microsoft Word, and refreshes a preview in the
    RStudio Viewer pane.
